--- The Project ---

A movie ticket booking system at scale with multiple cities, multiple theaters per city, multiple
shows per theater, and seat-level booking. The system should support seat selection with timebound holds
that release automatically on expiry, multiple pricing tiers (regular, premium,
weekend) and discount codes, payment, booking confirmation, and refunds on cancellation
under configurable refund policies. Multiple users may attempt to book the same seat at the
same time, and the system must correctly serialize bookings without double-allocation.
Confirmation and reminder notifications should be delivered without blocking the booking flow.

Roles: admin (manage cities, theaters, shows, seat layouts, pricing tiers, and refund policies)
and customer (browse shows, book and cancel seats, view booking history).


---Functionalities---

- system supports multiple cities, theatres, shows
- users can search the shows based on city and movie name
- users can view a particular show details eg. timing and available seats
- can select multiple seats with TTL that release automatically on expiry
- multiple pricing tiers is supported eg. regular, premium
- discount codes
- payment and booking confirmation
- view booking history
- booking cancellations and refunds under different refund policies
- handle the double booking
- confirmation and reminder notifications should be delivered without blocking the booking flow
- Role based access
    Admin : manage cities, theaters, shows, seat layouts, pricing tiers, and refund policies
    Customer : browse shows, book and cancel seats, view booking history

Assumptions:
- After seat selection user will land on the checkout page
- On checkout page total payable amount, payment methods and coupon codes section will be shown
- If user enters the coupon code then checkout page will be reloaded with the new payable amount
- payment journey is only simulated with some wait time. No actual redirection/payment debit will happen.
- Complete payment lifecycle is not supported as of now
- booking cancellation will be allowed only before the show starts with some gap lets say 30min
- notifications will be simulated with the logging only


Nice to have / Out of scope:
- discount offers are not being but design will be pluggable to add them later
- seat layout mapping is not supported right now
- user level communication preferences



