Core Booking flow

1. Post /holds
--> lock seats using for update
--> validate all are available
--> create seat hold

2. GET /holds/{id}/checkout
--> hold validation and discount, payment calculation

3. POST /bookings
--> validate the seat holds and create booking in pending status

4. POST /payments
--> create a payment processing entry
--> Simulate payment redirection delay
--> Based on result update payment status
--> If success check the holds if expired then refund else confirm the bookings and tickets
--> If failed then seat locks will still be held





























